@startuml
!include _style.iuml
autonumber
title Sequence Diagram - Correct Password from a Blocked IP / Locked Account

actor "Browser" as B
participant "CsrfFilter" as CSRF
participant "LoginProtection\nFilter" as LPF
participant "ClientIpResolver" as CIR
participant "LoginProtection\nService" as LPS
participant "UsernamePassword\nAuthenticationFilter" as UPAF
database "MySQL" as DB

B -> CSRF : POST /login (correct email + password)
CSRF -> LPF : token valid
LPF -> CIR : resolve(request)
CIR --> LPF : visitor IP (CF-Connecting-IP on Render)
LPF -> LPS : checkBeforeLogin(ip, email)
LPS -> DB : active block for ip? lock for email+ip?\naccount under attack and ip never used?
DB --> LPS : yes
LPS --> LPF : Denial(reason, until)
LPF -> LPS : recordDenied(...)
LPS -> DB : INSERT login_attempts (BLOCKED, reason)
LPF --> B : redirect /login?blocked&wait=M or /login?locked&wait=M
note over LPF, UPAF #fbeaea
  The chain stops here. The password is not checked,
  no session is created and the expiry is NOT extended.
end note
@enduml
